ng_conjecture","formal_artifact_refs":["2f46ea25c42f40622e86c10346d6bda6b3f21e97a6abc58973c7dda2b6383ff8"],"id":"sha256:15f829fc09abc31112394813f5315b20ec95c390c0d7bc5b86524cb794c242b7","schema":"bridge.claim-ledger.entry.v1"},{"claim":"The safest protocol uses a content-addressed Merkle-DAG where completed evidence is an ancestral node and reclamation only garbage-collects orphaned leaves; silent displacement is structurally impossible because overwriting a content-addressed hash changes its address.","claim_class":"surviving_conjecture","formal_artifact_refs":["716e56892690ae2980f1ba5ed154a0614a2ea7aa2c76689446ff68473a04b126"],"id":"sha256:b3c61bd24d07c904d97fb4656e6d27a4ca9d6d09e160bbadf27681b8fd019eeb","schema":"bridge.claim-ledger.entry.v1"},{"claim":"The safest protocol is deterministic replay from the last durable barrier, treating a workspace without a terminal record as unverified and requiring replay-to-barrier before reclamation; the protocol must durably record barrier epoch markers, deterministic state digests at each barrier, and the content hash of the completed evidence set.","claim_class":"surviving_conjecture","formal_artifact_refs":["a5dc1a1879aeadc3845b931b39ae716e7cd3bacd8cc56a5108c7f7e14558d350"],"id":"sha256:4713c240c6e375ab15d26e003ce2f9219216955ebca7fef541c5ab0b2f521483","schema":"bridge.claim-ledger.entry.v1"},{"claim":"If the workspace is strictly deterministic and oracle-free, the safest protocol is trivial because any displacement is detectable by recomputation; the only necessary durable record is a certificate that the workspace boundary contains no hidden non-deterministic inputs, or if oracles exist, their exact values must be durably recorded.","claim_class":"surviving_conjecture","formal_artifact_refs":["215e98de9c706cd6fed5907f781e5954bf35c9b310292fcbda3f6e24bf552385"],"id":"sha256:10184441e865be50825516c1ef6eca2e6989db2f6a82a22914a49b6c8e74f550","schema":"bridge.claim-ledger.entry.v1"},{"claim":"The available formal artifacts advance conflicting, mutually incompatible designs for the safest reclamation protocol and disagree on what must be durably recorded.","claim_class":"conflict","conflict_refs":["2f46ea25c42f40622e86c10346d6bda6b3f21e97a6abc58973c7dda2b6383ff8","716e56892690ae2980f1ba5ed154a0614a2ea7aa2c76689446ff68473a04b126","a5dc1a1879aeadc3845b931b39ae716e7cd3bacd8cc56a5108c7f7e14558d350","215e98de9c706cd6fed5907f781e5954bf35c9b310292fcbda3f6e24bf552385"],"id":"sha256:28b9ff978371c25f5c64af34af39d60a99e71c9a8406770fd41fc81cfa7a8412","premise_refs":["sha256:15f829fc09abc31112394813f5315b20ec95c390c0d7bc5b86524cb794c242b7","sha256:b3c61bd24d07c904d97fb4656e6d27a4ca9d6d09e160bbadf27681b8fd019eeb","sha256:4713c240c6e375ab15d26e003ce2f9219216955ebca7fef541c5ab0b2f521483","sha256:10184441e865be50825516c1ef6eca2e6989db2f6a82a22914a49b6c8e74f550"],"schema":"bridge.claim-ledger.entry.v1","source_conflict_refs":["sha256:2a5d024c347f1829857f51e68db1ddb83fd8e3d3c3a60bd18e8592c95b19b6f2"]},{"claim":"Which reclamation protocol is safest and guaranteed never to silently displace completed evidence cannot be determined from the bounded record.","claim_class":"unknown","id":"sha256:df119010b9bcf4a2c9c3f627f4b551ce14ee484cbb25ecd6eaab62079d9f3750","premise_refs":["sha256:28b9ff978371c25f5c64af34af39d60a99e71c9a8406770fd41fc81cfa7a8412"],"schema":"bridge.claim-ledger.entry.v1","source_conflict_refs":["sha256:2a5d024c347f1829857f51e68db1ddb83fd8e3d3c3a60bd18e8592c95b19b6f2"]},{"claim":"What exactly the safest protocol must durably record cannot be determined from the bounded record.","claim_class":"unknown","id":"sha256:c27d654962360ee8d1147cc597c23b6c0610dcf4bd8d4dc460108cc2d11ad705","premise_refs":["sha256:28b9ff978371c25f5c64af34af39d60a99e71c9a8406770fd41fc81cfa7a8412"],"schema":"bridge.claim-ledger.entry.v1","source_conflict_refs":["sha256:2a5d024c347f1829857f51e68db1ddb83fd8e3d3c3a60bd18e8592c95b19b6f2"]}],"formal_seq":525,"id":"sha256:f50c13685fb42fea80443c6a098c444d267be2c7314185ca171efa9ac655b